  "description": "The OASIS BootLoader provides a single entry point to initialise the entire OASIS ecosystem in any .NET application. Reads OASISDNA configuration, registers and activates all configured providers, sets up Auto-FailOver/LoadBalancing, and returns a ready-to-use OASIS instance. Integrate 55+ decentralised networks into your app with just a few lines of code. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one",
